    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on some briefing notes for the council meeting regarding the new affordable housing mandate. We need to decide on the distribution logic for the new units. In your view, what is the most equitable way to distribute the housing: through a lottery, based strictly on income levels, or by prioritizing proximity to transit hubs? I need a recommendation we can stand behind.",
